WEBVTT

00:07:59.808 --> 00:08:02.895
Kramatorsk train station massacred.

00:08:04.271 --> 00:08:06.732
And worse is yet to come.

00:08:07.608 --> 00:08:11.904
And these horrors
are not from Poland in 1945.

00:08:12.696 --> 00:08:15.699
Not from Rwanda in 1994.

00:08:16.325 --> 00:08:19.078
Not Aleppo 2016.

00:08:19.078 --> 00:08:22.122
This is Europe this week.

00:08:24.333 --> 00:08:26.335
How could this happen?

00:08:27.169 --> 00:08:30.714
How did we forget what evil can do?